    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "OuraneCloud, as a French sovereign cloud provider, will ensure data sovereignty and hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ligeo Santé, with Ligeo Santé health-IT integration expertise, will focus on integrating Faber IA solution with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), while also ensuring compliance with health interoperability standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our team at Faber IA will lead the development of the AI assistance solution, utilizing Faber IA flagship product Atelier to forge a document-grounded AI assistant tailored to the hospital staff's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA will work closely with the French public AI research laboratory to leverage the French public AI research laboratory expertise in retrieval-augmented generation and explainability, ensuring that our solution provides reliable and trustworthy outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given Faber IA available capacity, Faber IA can dedicate a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead to this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA governance practices, including a joint steering committee and operational committee, will ensure effective communication and decision-making throughout this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements for continuity of care and avoiding rupture in workflows, Faber IA will conduct a thorough analysis of existing practices and clinical or administrative processes during the Framing phase. a thorough analysis of existing practices and clinical or administrative processes will inform Faber IA Design phase, where Faber IA will develop a tailored solution that fits into current workflows and ensures seamless integration with existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA agile approach, with two-week sprints and demonstrable increments, will allow Faber IA to adapt to changing requirements and deliver a high-quality solution that meets the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following Faber IA adapted version of standard public-sector project frameworks, Faber IA will ensure that all deliverables are properly documented and meet the required standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Through this coordinated effort, the consortium can produce a coherent tender response that addresses the client's requirements for improving efficiency, quality, and safety of care delivered to patients, while ensuring continuity of care and avoiding disruption to existing workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide a level of security, integrate with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), support health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), and ensure data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system must also adapt to the clinical and administrative context, provide response times compatible with daily clinical use (< 2 seconds for common queries), and achieve high availability (99.9%)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technical stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do you propose? our platform, Atelier, is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be used to provide intelligent assistance to hospital staff. our have capabilities for API design, health interoperability, and identity management, including single sign-on (SSO) using SAML and OIDC, which can help address the security requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing SIH and DPI systems, our can leverage our standard connectors and custom adapters for sih_dpi_integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our company's platform, Atelier supports health interoperability standards, including FHIR, as mentioned in our health_interoperability capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data sovereignty, our hosting options include a Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and EU-only, ensuring that data is hosted exclusively within the European Union and not transferred outside of the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company's platform, Atelier architecture is designed to provide high availability, with active-active redundancy across two availability zones, and our have a target availability of 99.9%. our also have built-in monitoring, logging, and observability capabilities to ensure Our company's platform, Atelier performance and responsiveness." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve response times compatible with daily clinical use, Our company's platform, Atelier performance metrics indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds for common queries, with 95% of queries below 2.5 seconds. a median latency of 1.3 seconds for common queries, with 95% of queries below 2.5 seconds should meet the requirement of responding to common queries in under 2 seconds." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of adapting to the clinical and administrative context, Our company's platform, Atelier Answer layer provides grounded responses with source citations and retrieval traces, which can help ensure that the system's output is relevant and accurate." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these capabilities, I propose an architecture that leverages Our company's platform, Atelier, hosted on OuraneCloud Sovereign HDS tier, with integration to existing SIH and DPI systems using our standard connectors and custom adapters. our will also implement our health interoperability capabilities to support HL7 and FHIR standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure high availability and responsiveness, our will configure our platform with active-active redundancy and monitor our platform performance closely." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and the protection of personal and health data as special category data under GDPR Art. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also ensure data sovereignty, with hosting exclusively within the European Union, and no transfer of data outside the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls and compliance measures do we need to implement to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the client's requirements for strict compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and the protection of personal and health data as special category data under GDPR Art. 9, we can leverage we existing certifications and security controls.  we are already ISO 27001 certified since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services, ensuring a robust information security management system is in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we ISO 27701 certification provides an extension for privacy information management, which is crucial for handling special category data under GDPR Art. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For health-data hosting, we hold the HDS certification through we hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud. hold ensures that we processing on our hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud complies with the requirements for hosting health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security controls, we implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. we also practice pseudonymisation and data minimisation to protect sensitive information. we key management is based on the European Union infrastructure, adding an extra layer of compliance with GDPR requirements. we system is designed with tenant isolation in mind, ensuring strict separation between client corpora and per-engagement logical separation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
